{"story":{"id":"event-first-contact-critters-50","title":{"zh":"野蛮迹象","en":"Signs of Barbarism"},"category":"society","kind":"family","image":"art/bb11b683faff8996faeb.webp","start":"first_contact_critters.50","chapters":2,"visible":true,"excerpt":{"zh":"尽管他们生活在居住站上的事实暗示了他们很可能是一个先进的社会，然而[This.Owner.GetEnvoy][This.Leader.GetName]不能肯定我们是不是真的在和一种智慧生命形式打交道：他们似乎无时不刻在展现敌意，这对于一个稳定的社会而言是不可想象的：即便在我们短暂的调查期间也展现了数次纯粹的野蛮行为。\n\n他们看起来具有语言，但我们的[This.Owner.GetLinguists]仍在努力解析当中，以便我们在未来能够理解他们的行为。","en":"Although their dwellings on habitat stations would suggest an advanced society, [This.Owner.GetEnvoy] [This.Leader.GetName] is unsure whether we are indeed dealing with an intelligent lifeform: they seem unremittingly hostile, so much so that a stable society "},"review":{"status":"reviewed","date":"2026-10-13","reviewer":"c7b-society (resumed)","scope":{"zh":"掠夺者首次接触：2个事件及阶段衔接。","en":"掠夺者 first contact: 2 events and the stage hand-off."},"sources":["events/first_contact_NPC_country_types_events.txt:743-839","common/first_contact/01_first_contact_space_fauna_and_NPCs.txt:209-247"],"uncertain":[],"guide":"public/summaries/event-first-contact-critters-50.md"},"tree":{"root":"n0","nodes":{"n0":{"doc":null,"children":["n1"]},"n1":{"doc":"first_contact_critters.50","parent":"n0","via":{"kind":"entry","triggers":[{"zh":"首次接触","en":"First contact"}]},"children":["n2"]},"n2":{"doc":"first_contact_critters.55","parent":"n1","via":{"kind":"bridge","label":{"zh":"进入阶段：marauders_stage_2(难度5)","en":"Stage: marauders_stage_2 (difficulty 5)"},"conditional":true,"source":"content/stories/event-first-contact-critters-50.json","optionIndex":0,"option":"first_contact_critters.50.A"},"children":[]}}}},"chapters":[{"id":"first_contact_critters.50","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"野蛮迹象","en":"Signs of Barbarism"},"texts":[{"zh":"尽管他们生活在居住站上的事实暗示了他们很可能是一个先进的社会，然而[This.Owner.GetEnvoy][This.Leader.GetName]不能肯定我们是不是真的在和一种智慧生命形式打交道：他们似乎无时不刻在展现敌意，这对于一个稳定的社会而言是不可想象的：即便在我们短暂的调查期间也展现了数次纯粹的野蛮行为。\n\n他们看起来具有语言，但我们的[This.Owner.GetLinguists]仍在努力解析当中，以便我们在未来能够理解他们的行为。","en":"Although their dwellings on habitat stations would suggest an advanced society, [This.Owner.GetEnvoy] [This.Leader.GetName] is unsure whether we are indeed dealing with an intelligent lifeform: they seem unremittingly hostile, so much so that a stable society seems almost unthinkable: even during our brief period of investigation, we have observed several displays of pure barbarism.\n\nThey seem to have a language, but our [This.Owner.GetLinguists] are still working on deciphering it so we can make sense of this display."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/bb11b683faff8996faeb.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"first_contact_critters.50.A","label":{"zh":"真令人不舒服。我们可得小心。","en":"Disturbing. We must be watchful."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":false,"next":[{"target":"first_contact_critters.55","kind":"bridge","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"bridge","source":"content/stories/event-first-contact-critters-50.json","label":{"zh":"进入阶段：marauders_stage_2(难度5)","en":"Stage: marauders_stage_2 (difficulty 5)"},"story":"event-first-contact-critters-50"}],"terminal":false}],"next":[],"source":{"file":"events/first_contact_NPC_country_types_events.txt","line":742},"names":{"This.Leader.GetName":{"zh":"这位领袖","en":"the leader"}}},{"id":"first_contact_critters.55","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"遭遇[encountered_marauder.GetRealName]","en":"[encountered_marauder.GetRealName] Encountered"},"texts":[{"zh":"我们完成了对他们使用语言的破译，[This.Owner.GetEnvoy][This.Leader.GetName]将[encountered_marauder.GetName]识别为一种游牧文明，称为[encountered_marauder.GetRealName]。他们在[marauder_system.GetName]恒星系附近占据了数个大型空间站，其大量的人口都居住在拥挤而肮脏的环境之中。尽管如此，或许正因如此，他们似乎发展出了一种非常尚武的文化。生活在冰冷虚空中成了他们的第二天性，因而高度擅长太空作战。\n\n[encountered_marauder.GetSpeciesName]没有中央政府一说，而是分为数个不同的派系，不断地互相争夺资源与尊严。鉴于其庞大的人口与空间站造船能力，若无永无止境的内斗，他们必将成为严重威胁到全星系和平的势力。","en":"Having decoded what counts as a language among them, [This.Owner.GetEnvoy] [This.Leader.GetName] has identified the [encountered_marauder.GetName] as a nomadic civilization known as the [encountered_marauder.GetRealName]. They occupy a number of large space stations in and around the [marauder_system.GetName] system that house the bulk of their massive numbers in crowded and squalid conditions. Despite this, or perhaps because of it, they seem to have developed a strong martial culture. Life in the cold void has become second nature to them, and they are very adept at space warfare.\n\nThere is no [encountered_marauder.GetSpeciesName] central government to speak of. Instead, they are divided into several different factions that vie endlessly with one another for resources and respect. Given their large population and the shipbuilding capability of their stations, this constant infighting is the only thing keeping them from growing into a significant threat to galactic peace."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/3745f25faed16562b16c.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"marauder.1.a","label":{"zh":"尝试与他们联络。","en":"Attempt to contact them."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":false,"next":[{"target":"galactic_features.387","kind":"option","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"option","group":"c13974","when":[[[{"type":"other","key":"is_country_type","arg":"default","scope":"contact_country","value":false}],[{"type":"other","key":"has_first_contact_flag","arg":"hostile_first_contact_attempted","scope":"","value":true}]],[[{"type":"flag","scope":"country","name":"tiyanki_graveyard_survey","path":"","value":true}]]],"source":"common/scripted_effects/first_contact_effects.txt:178","story":"event-galactic-features-387"},{"target":"cara.1020","kind":"option","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"option","group":"c13974","when":[[[{"type":"other","key":"is_country_type","arg":"default","scope":"contact_country","value":false}],[{"type":"other","key":"has_first_contact_flag","arg":"hostile_first_contact_attempted","scope":"","value":true}]],[[{"type":"other","key":"any_c